<title>GREECE: DRACHMA FIRMS ON SALES OF 100MLN ECUS FROM LONDON-DEALERS.</title>
<headline>DRACHMA FIRMS ON SALES OF 100MLN ECUS FROM LONDON-DEALERS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecu/drachma eased to 312.23/33 from 312.40/50 at mid-session on sales of 100 million ecus from a London-based German bank, dealers said.</p>
</text>
